  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria Floods Acute Crisis Joint Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed integrated WASH and Nutrition intervention aims to prevent waterborne diseases, address malnutrition, and improve public health outcomes: 1. IRC will provide emergency water trucking for immediate access to at least 15l/pp/day clean water in IDP camps. Boreholes will be disinfected and rehabilitated2. Emergency latrines will be constructed in both IDP camps, host communities and around stabilization centers3. Intensification of cultural acceptable and gender sensitive Hygiene awareness campaigns including distribution of soap4. establishment of integrated nutrition treatment centers in IDP camps</narrative>
  </description>
